  <section class="em-intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-body">
        <p class="em-lead">We use ChurchSuite to help people stay connected with parish life — updating details, signing up for events, and managing rotas.</p>
        <h3>How to get access</h3>
        <p>For security reasons you cannot create an account yourself. Access is by invitation from the parish office. If you worship with us regularly and would like a My ChurchSuite login, email <a href="mailto:info@emmanuelnw6.com">info@emmanuelnw6.com</a> and we will send you an invite.</p>
        <h3>Already invited?</h3>
        <p>Use the button below to open the ChurchSuite login page. Search for Emmanuel Church West Hampstead (or follow the link in your invitation email), then sign in with the email address that received the invite.</p>
        <p>If you have forgotten your password, use “Forgotten password?” on the login screen. If you are still stuck, contact the parish office and we will help.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <h4>Log in</h4>
          <p>Opens ChurchSuite in a new tab.</p>
          <a href="https://login.churchsuite.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="em-btn em-btn--primary" style="margin-top:8px">ChurchSuite Login</a>
        </div>
        <div class="em-aside-card" style="margin-top:16px">
          <h4>Need help?</h4>
          <p><a href="mailto:info@emmanuelnw6.com">info@emmanuelnw6.com</a><br/><a href="tel:+447751534297">07751 534 297</a></p>
          <a href="contact.html" class="em-readmore">Contact page →</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
